# The Fire Nation Drill: "{1}: Permanents your opponents control lose hexproof and indestructible until end of turn." Bot2's
# Gladecover Scout has hexproof, so Bot1's Lightning Bolt cannot target it (the refusal); after Bot1 pays {1} for the Drill's
# ability and it resolves, the Scout can be targeted and the Bolt kills it.

